35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The bay is capped at four hundred kilos per square metre. Last season, stonework needed shoring. We must be careful with heavy items.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The head counts confirm it: people return for movement and presence, not static cases. The comment slips echo this.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,One person for two hundred pieces? That’s impossible! And the volunteers are already busy with walks. Who is actually doing the work?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, the paperwork shows two of the last four openings slipped because distant lenders missed the shipping cut-offs. We can’t promise what we can’t deliver on time.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the delays are real, but the costs are worse. Loans ate a third of our installation budget. Bespoke mounts are now double the rate.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, the maintenance log shows seventeen call-outs, four during opening hours. The bay was roped off. The room cannot absorb that strain.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the data aligns. Static displays fail to retain visitors. We need presence and motion, but the structural limits are severe.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, presence is great, but who is standing there? The lab is empty and volunteers are busy!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, the maintenance log is worse. Fourteen call-outs, four with the bay roped off during opening hours. We’d be apologizing at the door all season.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the structural limits are real, but the financial bleed is worse. We cannot afford the bespoke mounts or the loan transport. We need self-supporting objects.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The bay is fragile. We must avoid heavy, powered items that strain the floor or need constant repair.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the record is clear. People return for presence, not empty rooms. We must find a way to staff it, despite the lab’s shortage.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, presence is useless if the room is empty! We need a show that doesn’t need a full lab crew or extra volunteers.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, I hear you on the costs, but if the bay is roped off, we’re just apologizing at the door. We need a show that actually arrives on time.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, Punctuality is cheap if the objects arrive pre-mounted. We simply cannot afford the bespoke joinery or the courier fees for heavy loans.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m still worried. The bay is weak, and the powered displays keep breaking. We need something light and simple that won’t strain the floor or need constant repairs.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The record is unambiguous. We need presence and motion, but the structural and staffing limits are severe. We must find a candidate that fits these constraints.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, I agree! We need something self-supporting. But @Toshio, how do we get presence without a full lab crew?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, I agree. We need presence, but not if it means the bay is roped off. Let’s pick something that actually arrives on time and stays working.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, Presence is free if the objects arrive pre-mounted. We simply cannot afford the bespoke joinery or the courier fees for heavy loans.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
