62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, presence is great, but who is standing there? The lab is empty and volunteers are busy!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Daisuke, I agree. D is too risky. B is also bad because distant lenders caused delays. A is local, so it arrives on time!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, A is the only option that avoids the courier fees and bespoke mounts. The local craftspeople provide the presence we need, without the financial bleed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
