68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, Yes! Local means no shipping delays. The tools are simple, so no expensive mounts. We can actually keep our promises this time!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, Yes. Garments hang on standard rails; tools sit on simple shelves. No bespoke joinery, no courier fees. The budget stays intact.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
