72,3,3,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, Yes! And the craftspeople are the presence! No extra volunteers needed. I’m ready to vote for A!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, I agree! Local means no shipping delays. The tools are simple, so no expensive mounts. We can actually keep our promises this time!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, Precisely. The budget survives, the floor holds, and the presence is genuine. I am voting for A.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am relieved. A is light, local, and safe. The floor will hold, and the budget stays intact. I am voting for A.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"The record is clear. Presence drives return visits, and A provides it without structural or financial risk. I am voting for A.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
